 settlement and indeed, you will have what you have asked.\" And they were covered with humiliation and poverty and returned with anger from Allāh [upon them]. That was because they [repeatedly] disbelieved in the signs of Allāh and killed the prophets without right. That was because they disobeyed and were [habitually] transgressing.","j":1,"h":1,"s":2,"a":61,"sd":null}],"juz":1,"hizb":1,"surahs":[2],"sajdah":false}